					<section class="">
	<div class="text-container">
		
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-xl-8 offset-xl-2">
							
							
							
							<p>A <strong>Central Coordinator</strong> can access the Member Section to configure the following ECC technical infrastructure: </p><ul class="content-list"> 	<li> 	<p>C7 GUI Certificates</p> 	</li> 	<li> 	<p>C7 FIXML</p> 	</li> 	<li> 	<p>Leased Lines</p> 	</li> 	<li> 	<p>Common Report Engine (CRE)</p> 	</li> </ul>
