<p><!--StartFragment --></p>
<p>To gain access to the Member Section, you must have completed the onboarding process with EEX and/or ECC.</p>
<p><!--EndFragment --></p>
<p>As a Central Coordinator or their deputy, you can create new Member Section user accounts for staff members of your company.</p>
