<div class="intraNav" id="52100" data-intranav="Eurex T7 GUI"></div><section class="mt-xl-4 mt-md-3 mt-2">
	<div class="text-container">
		
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-xl-8 offset-xl-2">
							
								<h2>Eurex T7 GUI</h2>
							
							
							
							<p>The Eurex T7 GUI provides easy access for trading EEX products on the derivatives and spot markets, including Trade Registration for clearing. Connection is possible via internet and leased line.</p>
<p>One workstation is required for each workplace. This workstation is connected to a multi-member front-end system operated by EEX via the internet. A firewall concept, a personal secure ID token, and the use of a public/private key protect the EEX trading system against unauthorized third-party access. The personal secure ID token is provided to the exchange participant or non-trading broker by the EEX for use by every trader. If several users are connected to the trading system, one token per user is required for simultaneous access. The token is not specific to the workstation.</p>
<h3>What T7 offers</h3>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
	</div>
</section>

