</section><div class="intraNav" id="52089" data-intranav="C7 Eurex Clearing System"></div><section class="mt-xl-3 mt-md-2 mt-1">
	<div class="text-container">
		
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-xl-8 offset-xl-2">
							
								<h2>C7 Eurex Clearing System</h2>
							
							
							
							<ul class="content-list"> 	<li>Trade and position management for derivatives </li> 	<li>Risk management  </li> 	<li>Collateral management including the delivery of the respective reports  </li> 	<li>Complete overview of trades and positions, margin requirements, payments and deliveries for each product and member </li> </ul><h3><br> C7 offers</h3><ul class="content-list"> 	<li>State-of-the-art clearing system on one common architecture with Eurex Clearing </li> 	<li>Market standard and low footprint interfaces simplify system integration </li> 	<li>Shorter time-to-market for launching new products and greater responsiveness to changing regulatory demands</li> </ul><h3><br> Type of users and their functionalities</h3>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
	</div>
</section>

