</section>	<section class="">
	<div class="text-container">
		
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-xl-8 offset-xl-2">
							
							
							
							<h3>Pre-conditions and access</h3>
<p>C7 GUI access is:</p><ol> 	<li>Mandatory for all Institution Clearing Member (GCM/DCM)  </li> 	<li>Optional for Non-Clearing Members (NCMs): NCMs can request access and user to monitor and/ or transfer positions </li> 	<li>Not required for DCP CMs, nEHS Member or any other Spot only member. Those members do not require access to C7 since no product setup is available in C7.</li> </ol><p>To manage user setup in C7 we kindly ask you to raise a request in the <a href="https://customerportal.eex.com/servicedesk/customer/portal/1/group/3" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Customer Portal</a> under the section User Maintenance.<br>  </p>
<p>Further Pre-conditions are required:  </p><ul class="content-list"> 	<li> 	<p>Certificate needs to be installed</p> 	</li> </ul>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
	</div>
</section>

